@startuml CPN-05-buildCouponContext-sequence
title CPN-05 — Séquence : extraction contexte (SC vs API) -> visitorKey commun

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F4EC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #4A4A42
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #EAEFE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #6B7A5E

actor Visiteur as V

box "Point 1 — Affichage /kit (Server Component)" #FBF9F3
  participant "kit/page.tsx\n(headers()/cookies())" as SC
end box

box "Point 2 — Checkout (API route)" #FBF9F3
  participant "/api/checkout/order\n(req.headers)" as API
end box

participant "couponContext\nFromServerComponent()" as ADSC
participant "couponContext\nFromApiRequest(req)" as ADAPI
participant "buildCouponContext(src, opts)\n(coeur partagé, server-only)" as CORE

== Affichage (SSR) ==
V -> SC : GET /kit  (cookies: _fbp, session ; headers: UA, referer ; query: utm_source)
SC -> ADSC : headers()/cookies()
ADSC -> ADSC : normaliser en HeaderSource\n{ get, getCookie, getQuery }
ADSC -> CORE : buildCouponContext(src, { now, currency })
CORE -> CORE : trafficSource = utm > referer > 'direct'
CORE -> CORE : device = ua -> mobile|tablet|desktop
CORE -> CORE : visitorType = cookie récurrence ? returning : first
CORE -> CORE : visitorKey = hash(source canonique: session||_fbp)\nou null si absent
note right of CORE
  hash anonyme stable, sans PII,
  indépendant de now.
  visitorKey null => treatment en aval (CPN-04).
end note
CORE --> ADSC : CouponContext { now, currency, trafficSource,\n device, visitorType, visitorKey }
ADSC --> SC : ctx_SC
SC -> SC : resolveProductPricing(input, ctx_SC)  // CPN-04 -> prix AFFICHÉ

== Checkout (POST) ==
V -> API : POST /api/checkout/order  (mêmes cookies _fbp/session)
API -> ADAPI : req.headers / cookies de la requête
ADAPI -> ADAPI : normaliser en HeaderSource (MÊME forme)
ADAPI -> CORE : buildCouponContext(src, { now, currency })
CORE --> ADAPI : CouponContext (MÊME visitorKey si mêmes cookies)
ADAPI --> API : ctx_API
API -> API : resolveProductPricing(input, ctx_API)  // CPN-04 -> prix REPRICÉ

== Invariant ==
note over SC, API #EAEFE6
  INV-1 : src équivalente => ctx_SC.visitorKey === ctx_API.visitorKey
  => même bucket (CPN-19) => prix AFFICHÉ == prix REPRICÉ
  => pas de PriceMismatchError 422 (CPN-08).
  Divergence structurellement impossible : un seul CORE,
  deux adaptateurs qui produisent la même HeaderSource.
end note

@enduml
